# Isolated build made by tests/deployRecoveryReal.live.test.ts. It builds its
# own copy rather than reading dist/, which is gitignored and which 
pm test`r
# never produces - a test that reads whatever build is lying in the working
# directory is how this suite once turned master red across three merges.
.tmp-recovery-build
